## Falsifier before a brief

Before authoring, apply the governing brief/claim contract. Where an empirical
claim permits a cheap challenge, run it PARENT-side and write against the observed
result (one-shot script, CSV sanity sweep, byte-identity or oracle-tier pre-check).
Governance choices require source/consumer verification; do not invent a hypothesis
or empirical number solely to fill an ADR form. Required research-brief falsifiers
and evidence remain required. Use the brief-authoring skill for structure; verify
every Rule-0 read is real (handoff-verify). Grounding: `lesson_run_cheap_falsifier_before_authoring`
+ `feedback_run_falsifier_before_brief`.
